    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Ancient magic lies so heavily upon you that it forms an eldritch ward, blunting energy from beyond the Material Plane; you and your allies have Resistance to Necrotic, Psychic, and Radiant damage while in your @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.classes.Item.phbpdnProtection].</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-kuCOxEuxal5gCdp1\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect that applies the Resistances but it is not automatically granted when a character enters/exits your aura.</p></section>",
